erLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a text area with a localized label, looking up the key in the given bundle.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextarea\/init(_:tablename:bundle:text:placeholder:helpertext:helperlink:isoutlined:constrainedmaxwidth:constrainedmaxheight:status:)","title":"init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)","kind":"symbol"}}}